  (text "Virtual ERC markers" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 87.63 128 0) (effects (font (size 1.03 1.03) (thickness 0.15) (bold yes) (color 0 70 190 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2673edc3-dc73-437a-a569-50fdb29e17e7"))
  (text "+24V_RAW and +24V_FUSED\nmark powered input nodes.\nThe GND marker establishes\nthe common reference.\nPhysical sources are on\nPOWER_INPUT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 87.63 132 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9) (thickness 0.12) (color 0 70 190 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "728ebeb2-6266-4866-9957-c22ebb65694c"))
  (text "Power system" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (thickness 0.15) (bold yes) (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d8dbcb7b-15b4-4312-b924-a88b6a34ae91"))
  (text "POWER_SYSTEM contains the protected 24 V input, the primary and secondary supply trees,\nprogramming switches, power control and rail monitoring. The STM32G0B1 stages startup; hardware\npermits can remove power independently of telemetry polling." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 44.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (thickness 0.12) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4bbb9c29-0ffc-4c87-b7be-10a0d952da3a"))
  (polyline (pts (xy 156.21 60.44) (xy 278.13 60.44)) (stroke (width 0.13) (type solid) (color 220 225 230 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "ad84e56b-51ce-445e-93d1-7f18fb0a2359"))
  (text "Digital and memory rails" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 62.23 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (thickness 0.15) (bold yes) (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ceb2a136-ad5e-4877-8296-fb53c3c49a8b"))
  (text "The FPGA intermediate supply feeds core, auxiliary, I/O, DDR and PHY rails. SYS3V3 supports the\nhost-facing power-control interface. These supply domains support matrix timing, data capture,\nmemory and communications in the MIRA platform." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 66.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (thickness 0.12) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7e62abb5-d976-4763-93ee-efe1af6e6445"))
  (polyline (pts (xy 156.21 82.03) (xy 278.13 82.03)) (stroke (width 0.13) (type solid) (color 220 225 230 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "ac97246f-5981-4e42-a359-0c435b2b509b"))
  (text "Analog and AFE rails" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 83.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (thickness 0.15) (bold yes) (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f5ea6f8e-bd95-4394-94cb-8629768e67f9"))
  (text "ANA6 feeds the low-noise ANA5 and ANA3V3 branches. P15 and N15 supply the bipolar analog front\nend and the programming switches. Keeping these domains separately controlled lets the power\nmanager qualify readiness before matrix operation." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 88.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (thickness 0.12) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "14f4e35f-f7d9-4077-bcdd-7c52f551d9ef"))
  (polyline (pts (xy 156.21 103.62) (xy 278.13 103.62)) (stroke (width 0.13) (type solid) (color 220 225 230 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "b11f6120-08b6-4537-b05a-cb067301de9c"))
  (text "Programming drive" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 105.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (thickness 0.15) (bold yes) (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6e3865ab-06eb-45af-beac-4c148593c00c"))
  (text "Positive and negative programming paths use the P15/N15 supplies. MATRIX_PERMIT qualifies\noperation; the programming interface returns PROG_V_P15 to the power manager. Switch gating and\noutput feedback are detailed on PROGRAM_SWITCHES." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 109.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (thickness 0.12) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "76e6d28a-2e0c-46a9-8cb5-8d4a2f1ad80b"))
  (polyline (pts (xy 156.21 125.21) (xy 278.13 125.21)) (stroke (width 0.13) (type solid) (color 220 225 230 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "5b76d379-a54a-4822-a7ac-af34c40433d1"))
  (text "Power source assertions" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (thickness 0.15) (bold yes) (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eaa49d1d-61e4-478d-8bdf-8b1f0158d185"))
  (text "The three PWR_FLAG symbols declare +24V_RAW, +24V_FUSED and GND as powered nodes for\nelectrical-rule checking. These virtual markers support ERC; the physical connector, fuse and\ninput protection are inside POWER_INPUT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 131.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (thickness 0.12) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6b6677ac-c93b-4bc1-9ce9-3a33ca382ccc"))
  (text "The native hierarchy on this root contains one child: POWER_SYSTEM." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 155.9 0) (effects (font (size 0.98 0.98) (thickness 0.12) (color 0 70 190 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7003bb57-147e-4c3a-ad71-698bef2014f7"))
